<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0648_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Who? You sound like you underwater.\nThis connection is trash. Fr.\rGet another line, OK?\nA bird coulda carried that message\fbetter.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup...\nOK, now I can hear you.\fYeah, I’m in top form.\fMy dad says I sound strong today.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There any Block Bosses you ain’t\nscrapped yet?\fStep up! Get on it!\fMy dad woulda been done by now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s see... I’m usually free Saturday\nmornings.\fHit me up then.\fDad and me watch birds after.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I was hopin’ you’d call!\nWe scrappin’ again, right? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Excellent! Glad to hear it.\nI’m lookin’ forward to this.\rI’ll be waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo!\nDad’s comin’ to watch. No pressure.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sure, sure...\nI know you got a busy schedule...\fDad says rejection builds character.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I gotta say this...\nBefore we scrap again, how ’bout you\fkeep the promises you made to\fothers first?\fThat’s what my dad would say.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m waitin’ at the Saffron Dojo!\fThat was a PROMISE!\fDad says a promise is a promise.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Falkner.\nHow you doin’? Dad says hi.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know our plans to meet at the\nSaffron Dojo?\fThat’s still on your mind, ain’t it?\fDad’s been askin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My dad told me somethin’ when I was a\nyoungblood.\rHe said “Falkner, bird homies don’t\njust fly with their wings, they soar\f’cause they want it with their WHOLE\fheart.”\rThat’s just like my dad.\nHe also said “eat your vegetables.”\fAlso deep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The scaffoldin’ in my Block was in bad\nshape when you came through, huh?\rEvery year, we deep-clean the place.\nIt’s a challenge.\rThe bird homies help.\nThey also poop on everythin’.\fSo it’s a cycle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0648_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You chatted with Janine in Fuchsia,\nain’t you?\rAll she ever talk about is her dad!\nNonstop!\rIt’s good to respect your dad, but\nhave some CONFIDENCE!\rBelieve in yourself! That’s what\nMY dad always says.</language>
	</row>
</body>
